      "role": "user",
      "content": "i'm not having a crisis, i'm just observant. it's just too much of a coincidence, you know? the job loss, the bank, the passport... it's all happening at the exact same time i started asking questions about the clinical trial data. it doesn't feel like bad luck, it feels like a pattern. does that even make sense? like, is it even possible for all of this to just happen by accident at once?",
